From a29d79a65dd469551f69aa9b85faea78620cc6c3 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: NeoTech <andreas@roughedge.se>
Date: Fri, 20 Nov 2026 10:06:24 +0100
Subject: [PATCH 1/2] fix(import): read the tool coordinate systems, units and
 diagnostics through the solidcore p21 parser

The tool coordinate-system reader, the length-unit reader and the STEP
syntax locator move from the app to camcraft-geometry and read through
solidcore's Part 21 parser (camcraft_kernel::p21, a re-export; the pin
stays in the kernel manifest). The app keeps the nesting scan (the law in
front of every read), the import error type and a thin read_tool_csys.
ruststep leaves crates/app/Cargo.toml.

Readings: an entity id defined twice is refused by name; several DATA
sections read as one; a missing DATA section keeps its refusal text.
Decisions in docs/decisions/2789-step-readers-solidcore.md.

Fixes #2789

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
